        "en": "Clients frequently praise Dr Chavira and the veterinary staff for their warmth, professionalism, and thorough approach to animal care. Many pet owners note that clinicians take extra time to answer questions and follow up by telephone after procedures. While one client noted a dismissive interaction at reception, the predominant feedback reflects high trust in the care team."
