        "en": "Reviewers report positive health outcomes for urgent surgical interventions, wound management, and effective treatment of chronic illnesses such as asthma and infections. Pet parents emphasize the diagnostic thoroughness of the practice, noting timely recoveries after tailored medical care."
      },
      "mentions": 8,
      "sentiment": "positive"
