        "en": "Communication experiences are generally positive, with reviewers praising detailed discussions of treatment plans and follow-up emails from veterinary doctors. However, a couple of clients reported difficulties obtaining clear phone quotes or receiving prompt updates regarding urgent walk-in policies."
